  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roma Survey in WB &amp; Turkiye (Output 3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Action is to advance Roma inclusion in Western Balkans and T&#xfc;rkiye, by fostering informed policy discourse and promoting, targeted and evidence-based policy making. This objective will be achieved through collecting and making available comprehensive quantitative and qualitative data as the basis for evidence-based policy making. Note-in T&#xfc;rkiye, as part of the Survey, qualitative data will be collected from one selected region of the country, focusing on one thematic area.</narrative>
  </description>
